          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*This poster is completely filled with highly saturated colors, bright enough to burn the eye in this bleak vagrant camp.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yo"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yo"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So how 'bout adding some challenges in your boring old life"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Come join the Rap Battles even if ya got no mic at the live"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Don't worry if your rhythm and rhyme seem just a bit too light"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Get on the stage and Dr. Dig might then give you a like"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Or maybe you just want to be a part of our big audience"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Then we've also got ways to heat up our ambiance"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Y'know the Rap Battles voting channels just went into existence"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And all the rappers are gon' be here, even with no influence"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So why you standing 'round giving all this hesitance"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Don't be here wastin'n your precious vote of confidence"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Please consult Dr. Dig for details on how to join or vote in this season of the Rap Battles!"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
